text: ['All creatures get -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'All damage that would be dealt this turn to target creature you control by a source of your choice is dealt to another target creature instead.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard X creature cards.\\nReturn X target creatures to their owners' hands.", 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card at random.\\nSonic Burst deals 4 damage to any target.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\\nTarget creature gets +X/+0 until end of turn.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nAdd {B}{B}{B}{B}.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses target player who controls more creatures than they do and is their opponent. The first player may reveal cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. If the first player does, that player puts that card onto the battlefield and all other cards revealed this way into their graveyard.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses target player who controls more lands than they do and is their opponent. The first player may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses target player who has more cards in hand than they do and is their opponent. The first player may discard their hand and draw three cards.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses target player who has more life than they do and is their opponent. The first player may have Oath of Mages deal 1 damage to the second player.", "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses target player whose graveyard has fewer creature cards in it than their graveyard does and is their opponent. The first player may return a creature card from their graveyard to their hand.", 'At the beginning of your end step, you may reveal your hand and put all land cards from it onto the battlefield. If you do, discard your hand.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if all nonland permanents you control are white, you gain 1 life.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have 10 or less life, you gain 1 life.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice School of Piranha unless you pay {1}{U}.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, tap Carnophage unless you pay 1 life.', 'Buyback costs cost {2} less.', 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nDestroy target artifact.', 'Buyback {3} (You may pay an additional {3} as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nDestroy target enchantment.', 'Buyback—Discard two cards. (You may discard two cards in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nCounter target spell.', 'Buyback—Pay 3 life, Discard a card at random. (You may pay 3 life and discard a card at random in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nDestroy target land.', "Buyback—Pay 4 life. (You may pay 4 life in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nDestroy target nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Buyback—Sacrifice a land. (You may sacrifice a land in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nCreate a 1/1 white Pegasus creature token with flying.', 'Buyback—Sacrifice a land. (You may sacrifice a land in addition to any other costs as you cast this spell. If you do, put this card into your hand as it resolves.)\\nYou gain 2 life.', 'Cast this spell only during your end step.\\nAs an additional cost to cast this spell, pay X life.\\nDraw X cards.', "Creatures that are enchanted can't attack or block.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nAt end of combat, exile all creatures blocked by Wall of Nets.\\nWhen Wall of Nets leaves the battlefield, return all cards exiled with Wall of Nets to the battlefield under their owners' control.", 'Discard a card: Thalakos Drifters gains shadow until end of turn. (It can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Discard a card: You may tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'Discard a creature card: Vampire Hounds gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Discard a land card: Seismic Assault deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Draw a card for each tapped creature target opponent controls.', 'Each creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature on the battlefield that shares at least one creature type with it. (For example, if two Goblin Warriors and a Goblin Shaman are on the battlefield, each gets +2/+2.)', 'Each creature you control can block an additional creature each combat.', 'Each player chooses from among the permanents they control an artifact, a creature, an enchantment, and a land, then sacrifices the rest.', "Enchant creature (Target a creature as you cast this. This card enters the battlefield attached to that creature.)\\nEnchanted creature has shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Enchant creature you control\\n{R}: Enchanted creature deals 1 damage to target creature with flying.', "Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player reveals the top card of their library. If that card is a land card, destroy that creature. Otherwise, it gets +3/+3 until end of turn.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.\\n{W}: Return Shackles to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.\\nWhen enchanted creature attacks or blocks, sacrifice Cunning at the beginning of the next cleanup step.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -1/-1 and has fear. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen enchanted creature dies, you draw two cards.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever an opponent casts a creature spell, put a +1/+1 counter on enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card.', "First strike, forestwalk, vigilance (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike, it can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest, and attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "First strike, protection from black and from red (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike. It can't be blocked, targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything black or red.)", 'First strike\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Pit Spawn unless you pay {B}{B}.\\nWhenever Pit Spawn deals damage to a creature, exile that creature.', 'Flying, first strike', "Flying\\nAs Entropic Specter enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nEntropic Specter's power and toughness are each equal to the number of cards in the chosen player's hand.\\nWhenever Entropic Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.", "Flying\\nDiscard a card: Return Ephemeron to its owner's hand.", "Flying\\nExalted Dragon can't attack unless you sacrifice a land. (This cost is paid as attackers are declared.)", 'Flying\\nThopter Squadron enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Thopter Squadron: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying. Activate only as a sorcery.\\n{1}, Sacrifice another Thopter: Put a +1/+1 counter on Thopter Squadron. Activate only as a sorcery.', "Flying\\nWhen Mirozel becomes the target of a spell or ability, return Mirozel to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Welkin Hawk dies, you may search your library for a card named Welkin Hawk, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "Flying\\n{U}: Put Wayward Soul on top of its owner's library.", 'For each blocking creature, flip a coin. If you win the flip, prevent all combat damage that would be dealt by that creature this turn.', 'For each creature, its controller sacrifices a permanent unless they pay {1}.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Mindless Automaton enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}, Discard a card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mindless Automaton.\\nRemove two +1/+1 counters from Mindless Automaton: Draw a card.', "Monstrous Hound can't attack unless you control more lands than defending player.\\nMonstrous Hound can't block unless you control more lands than attacking player.", "Pay 5 life: Destroy Volrath's Dungeon. Any player may activate this ability but only during their turn.\\nDiscard a card: Target player puts a card from their hand on top of their library. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Price of Progress deals damage to each player equal to twice the number of nonbasic lands that player controls.', 'Put a card from your hand on top of your library: The next time a black or red source of your choice would deal damage this turn, prevent that damage.', 'Put target card from your graveyard on top of your library.', 'Return two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Sacrifice Shield Mate: Target creature gets +0/+4 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice Skyshaper: Creatures you control gain flying until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice a Forest: Regenerate Rootwater Alligator.', 'Sacrifice a Forest: Target attacking creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.', "Sacrifice a creature, Return Recurring Nightmare to its owner's hand: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only as a sorcery.", "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nDauthi Warlord's power is equal to the number of creatures with shadow on the battlefield.", "Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nDiscard a card: Return Thalakos Scout to its owner's hand.", 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\nWhenever Soltari Visionary deals damage to a player, destroy target enchantment that player controls.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Destroy target creature with shadow.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)\\n{B}{B}, Sacrifice Dauthi Jackal: Destroy target blocking creature.', 'Skyshroud Elite gets +1/+2 as long as an opponent controls a nonbasic land.', 'Spells cost {1} more to cast.', 'Spike Cannibal enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nWhen Spike Cannibal enters the battlefield, move all +1/+1 counters from all creatures onto it.', 'Spike Hatcher enters the battlefield with six +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Hatcher: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Hatcher: Regenerate Spike Hatcher.', 'Spike Rogue enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Rogue: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from a creature you control: Put a +1/+1 counter on Spike Rogue.', 'Spike Weaver enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Weaver: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Weaver: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', "Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains flying until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'Target player discards three cards.', "Trample\\nAs Skyshroud War Beast enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nSkyshroud War Beast's power and toughness are each equal to the number of nonbasic lands the chosen player controls.", 'Until end of turn, creatures you control gain "{1}: Regenerate this creature."', 'Vigilance', 'When Anarchist enters the battlefield, you may return target sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Cartographer enters the battlefield, you may return target land card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Limited Resources enters the battlefield, each player chooses five lands they control and sacrifices the rest.\\nPlayers can't play lands as long as ten or more lands are on the battlefield.", 'When Mind Maggots enters the battlefield, discard any number of creature cards. For each card discarded this way, put two +1/+1 counters on Mind Maggots.', 'When Ravenous Baboons enters the battlefield, destroy target nonbasic land.', 'When Scrivener enters the battlefield, you may return target instant card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Treasure Hunter enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "When you cast a spell, return Jackalope Herd to its owner's hand.", 'When you play another land, sacrifice City of Traitors.\\n{T}: Add {C}{C}.', 'Whenever Avenging Druid deals damage to an opponent, you may reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a land card. If you do, put that card onto the battlefield and put all other cards revealed this way into your graveyard.', 'Whenever Charging Paladin attacks, it gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Crashing Boars attacks, defending player chooses an untapped creature they control. That creature blocks Crashing Boars this turn if able.', 'Whenever Elvish Berserker becomes blocked, it gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature blocking it.', 'Whenever Grollub is dealt damage, each opponent gains that much life.', 'Whenever Pygmy Troll becomes blocked by a creature, Pygmy Troll gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n{G}: Regenerate Pygmy Troll.', 'Whenever Rabid Wolverines becomes blocked by a creature, Rabid Wolverines gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Reckless Ogre attacks alone, it gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Scalding Salamander attacks, you may have it deal 1 damage to each creature without flying defending player controls.', "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, that creature's controller may have it deal damage equal to its power to any target of their choice.", 'Whenever a player casts a spell, Spellshock deals 2 damage to that player.', "Whenever a player casts a spell, that player returns a land they control to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, tap target creature.', "Whenever you cast a creature spell, you may pay {1}. If you do, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Workhorse enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Workhorse: Add {C}.', 'You have no maximum hand size.', '{0}: Remove target attacking creature you control from combat and untap it.', '{1}, {T}, Discard a card: Regenerate target creature.', "{1}, {T}: Return target creature to its owner's hand unless its controller pays {1}.", '{1}, {T}: Transmogrifying Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {1} to end this effect.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and is an artifact in addition to its other types.', "{1}{B}, Sacrifice Thrull Surgeon: Look at target player's hand and choose a card from it. That player discards that card. Activate only as a sorcery.", "{1}{U}: Look at the top card of target player's library.", '{1}{U}{U}, {T}: Dominating Licid loses this ability and becomes an Aura enchantment with enchant creature. Attach it to target creature. You may pay {U} to end this effect.\\nYou control enchanted creature.', '{2}, Discard a card at random: Ogre Shaman deals 2 damage to any target.', '{2}, {T}, Discard your hand: Counter target noncreature spell.', '{2}{B}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{2}{G}: Plated Rootwalla gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{2}{U}{U}, {T}: Counter target spell.', '{2}{U}{U}: Draw a card.', '{B}, {T}: Choose target opponent who had at least two fewer creature cards in their graveyard than you did as you activated this ability. Destroy target nonblack creature that player controls.', '{G}, Discard a creature card: Search your library for a creature card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{G}, {T}: Choose target opponent who controlled more creatures than you did as you activated this ability. Create a 2/2 green Beast creature token.', '{R}, {T}: Choose target opponent who had more life than you did as you activated this ability. Keeper of the Flame deals 2 damage to that player.', '{R}: Cinder Crawler gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate only if Cinder Crawler is blocked.', "{R}: Target creature can't be regenerated this turn.", '{T}, Discard a card at random: Mage il-Vec deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', '{T}: You choose target creature an opponent controls, and that opponent chooses target creature. Flip a coin. If you win the flip, destroy the creature you chose. If you lose the flip, destroy the creature your opponent chose.', '{U}, {T}: Choose target opponent who had at least two more cards in hand than you did as you activated this ability. Draw a card.', '{U}: Killer Whale gains flying until end of turn.', '{U}: Whiptongue Frog gains flying until end of turn.', '{W}, Discard a card: You gain 3 life.', '{W}, {T}: Choose target opponent who had more life than you did as you activated this ability. You gain 3 life.', '{X}{X}{B}: Destroy target nonblack creature with mana value X.']
flavor: ['" . . . And the third little boar built his house out of rootwalla plates . . . ."\\n—Skyshroud children\'s story', '". . . Dry-walkers die\\nWe feed on sweet flesh . . . ."\\n—*Rootwater Saga*', '"All Dauthi are jackals, regardless of breed."\\n—Lyna, Soltari emissary', '"Civilization is a conspiracy to disguise the mutilation of nature."\\n—Skyshroud elite creed', '"Consider the fable of the greedy herder. As her flock grew, so did her weariness; she slept, and the sheep wandered off."\\n—Karn, silver golem', '"Does this make me look fat?"', '"Everything the wise woman learned she wrote in a book, and when the pages were black with ink, she took white ink and began again."\\n—Karn, silver golem', '"Fear rules those weak enough to accept it."\\n—Greven *il*-Vec', '"Great chains shall free our warriors."\\n—Oracle *en*-Vec', '"History is a potent weapon."\\n—Karn, silver golem', '"Hope shall be the blade that severs our bonds."', '"Hup, two, three, four,\\nDunno how to count no more."\\n—Mogg march', '"I am confined by sleep and defined by nightmare."\\n—Crovax', '"I will flay the skin from your flesh and the flesh from your bones and scrape your bones dry. And still you will not have suffered enough."\\n—Greven *il*-Vec, to Gerrard', '"I\'ll take that. You won\'t need it when the revolution comes."', '"If we cannot live proudly, we die so!"\\n—Eladamri, Lord of Leaves', '"In Barrin\'s name!" cried Lyna as Hanna\'s sword passed through her, "Ertai sends word that the portal is open—but not for long!"', '"It is the art of convincing someone to live."\\n—Orim, Samite healer', '"It\'ll get us to the portal, but I can\'t guarantee what it\'ll do to the ship."\\n—Hanna, *Weatherlight* navigator', '"Just take a little off the top."', '"My enemies\' death yields threefold benefit: removal, reuse, and research."\\n—Volrath', '"My medicine bag and I have treated countless wounds and illnesses. But never have I seen so many made so sick for so long. We will *never* eat Squee\'s cooking again."\\n—Orim, journal', '"My ship . . . ," Sisay mumbled. "Intact," Gerrard reassured her, "which is more than I can say for you, my friend." Sisay laughed despite the pain.', '"On my death, I give you this treasure: the knowledge that life is hard, yet too soon past."\\n—Dal funeral rite', '"Our belief shall be the lance that pierces Volrath\'s heart."', '"Read the roots tell the tale\\nFuture forms in waving weeds\\nHigher than truth is hope."\\n—*Rootwater Saga*', '"Stay."', '"The blood of the weak shall be the ink with which we scribe great Yawgmoth\'s glorious name."\\n—Stronghold architect, journal', '"Volrath is not the only one who can shape this world to serve him."\\n—Eladamri, Lord of Leaves', '"Volrath stole everything there was of me."\\n—Takara', '"Was that *it*?"\\n—Ertai, wizard adept', '"What separates junk from treasure is imagination."\\n—Hanna, *Weatherlight* navigator', '"When I cut down my angel I only started my fall."\\n—Crovax', '"While we fought, the *il* surrendered."\\n—Oracle *en*-Vec', '"Who you callin\' \'shorty\'?"', '"no home no heart no hope"\\n—Stronghold graffito', 'A farewell to arms . . . and feet . . . and legs . . . .', 'A snap of fingers, a snap of teeth.', 'A sphere pushes equally in all directions.', 'A stroke of luck can smite an army.', "All Mirri wanted to do was rest, but she couldn't ignore a nagging suspicion as she followed Crovax's skulking form.", "Any mogg will tell you there's nothing more nauseating than the smell of cute.", 'Bores ruin a party. Boars are party to ruin.', 'Build something and the baboons will tear it down. Leave the pieces lying and they will scatter them.', 'Count carefully the souls and see that none are lost.\\n—Vec teaching', 'Eating is all it knows.', 'From nothing came teeth.', 'Furnace air crackles with magmatic cackles.', 'Give away everything so others have nothing.\\n—Brooch inscription', 'Heartwood brings peace in great symphonies where dryads conduct the trees through every note.', 'How do you map a world when the land moves beneath your feet?', 'Hues of recollection flicker like facets of a gem.', 'Hunger growls, never purrs.', 'Hunger is like the sea: deep, endless, and unforgiving.', 'If dragons excel at anything more than vanity, it is greed.', 'In Rath, there are only so many souls to go around.', 'In the depths of Rootwater, salvage and sewage differ only in texture.', 'In their twisted logic, to empty the shadow world is to escape it.', 'In war, as in society, position is everything.', 'Is there any other kind?', 'Its respiration is your expiration.', 'Karn and Hanna stood over the recovered Legacy artifacts like loving parents over sleeping children.', 'Life has always been a dance. It is only fitting that death sing the tune.', 'Living below a flowstone foundry produces a disproportionate number of fire mages among the *il*.', 'Lyna turned to the figure beside her. "They\'re gone. What now?"\\n"As ever," said Urza, "we wait."', 'Man versus nature is not a fair fight.', 'Mogglings caught in a misdeed often blame the grollub. Even though the creature is usually innocent, no taskmaster can resist an excuse to beat it.', 'Most creatures grow out of their baby teeth, but sabertooth wyverns grow into theirs.', 'Music scythes the savage beast.', 'Ogre shamans must be bright enough to learn their invocations and dim enough to use them.', 'Only by sacrificing any semblance of defense could Gerrard best Greven.', 'Only the warrior who can admit mortal weakness will be bolstered by immortal strength.', "Secure in the embrace of wood, they want no part of Eladamri's war.", "Selenia had hurt Mirri terribly, but injuries of the flesh could be treated. The wounds she had torn in Crovax's soul would never close.", 'Shackles of gold are still shackles.', "Some schools aren't worth getting into.", 'Subduing and skinning an alligator is the first rite of maturity adolescent merfolk must pass.', 'The *Weatherlight* dragged the *Predator* behind it, the cradle hauling the casket.', 'The *il*-Kor no longer roam the open plains, but they are still hunters.', "The crawler doesn't care what gets in its way. It pushes everything into the boiling muck and waits for the meal to cook.", "The flowstone seemed for a moment to assume Greven's rage—it lunged like a wild beast at the *Weatherlight*.", "The hounds' barks are a horrifying chorus of screams, moans, and whispers.", "The last thing to go through the mogg's mind was its teeth.", 'The less you have, the harder you fight for it.', "The mirozels are the only stars in Rath's opaque skies.", 'The tide of magic brought them here. Now it would take them home.', 'The true treasure no thief can touch.', 'The wise pay as much attention to what they throw away as to what they keep.', 'The wizard had it all—until she tried to use it.', 'Their favorite food? Wind dancers.', 'Their fury scatters enemies like a pile of dry leaves.', 'There is no such thing as a regiment of ogres.', "There's little more demeaning than getting your butt kicked by a bunch of bunnies.", 'They bear weightier burdens than the shields they carry.', 'They drift in and out of shadow and ever on toward madness.', "Three are the paths of the soul:\\nOne out—roam across the plain,\\nOne back—dwell with tribe and tent,\\nOne in—turn an enemy's hate.", 'Volrath has bred them to fear only him. Are they charging into battle, or merely fleeing his wrath?', 'War favors the informed.']
artist: ['Adam Rex', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Brom', 'Chippy', 'Ciruelo', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daniel Gelon', 'Daren Bader', 'Dermot Power', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Donato Giancola', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Heather Hudson', 'Jeff Laubenstein', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jim Nelson', 'Joel Biske', 'John Matson', 'Keith Parkinson', 'Kev Walker', 'M. W. Kaluta & DiTerlizzi', 'Mark Zug', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Sutfin', 'Mike Raabe', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Randy Elliott', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Kane Ferguson', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spencer', 'Scott Kirschner', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Stephen Daniele', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Val Mayerik', 'rk post']
