en, alle Landkarten von Deiner Hand direkt ins Spiel zu bringen. Wenn Du dies tust, wirf die restlichen Karten, die Du auf der Hand hast, ab.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ff5c24d-5d87-472c-8ff8-7b5195250adf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nexo con el maná', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbd798b7-1c70-4efe-8a5f-edf3378d64aa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lien de mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cf80b0a-13f8-4bfd-a343-cb1ba882d6cf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Legame di Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b86c0340-7da6-45f0-af3b-3469fd5e2097'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'マナ結合', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58b15a0f-e7da-43c7-9ecf-03053ef9a53b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Elo de Mana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29645d26-23ad-4d7b-bafe-e3420352b201'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Mirozel', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nBringe den Mirozel auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück, wenn der Mirozel das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit ist.', 'type': 'Beschwörung einer Illusion', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9635ae1d-d6ca-4b3a-af44-6ac24ccb4596'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mirocel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41f741a8-5d21-40e7-9e94-e9684012b3d8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mirozel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd80dc307-b3c0-40ae-b16e-6ec0a96d630c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mirozel', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cd8cc31-6b0a-4a58-8c96-f87b1954fd9c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ミロゼル', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fb31630-7