'Nausée', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c8cbfeb-c703-42d5-9497-6fb39eacce7c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nausea', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43e2321c-7d3b-4ae0-b4d7-8f24d353b17f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '吐き気', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc527b6d-906f-4e50-80b5-78b1d5822d3c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Náusea', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25bf5858-d854-444f-8fd4-d4cfa4e0e04e'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Überleben der Stärksten', 'text': '{G}, bestimme eine Kreaturenkarte auf Deiner Hand und wirf diese ab: Durchsuche Deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte, zeige diese Karte allen Spielern und nimm sie auf Deine Hand. Mische Deine Bibliothek danach neu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a802f637-4918-4b81-a81a-84ed6ffc8e70'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Supervivencia de los fuertes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e4118c0-00ab-4699-9412-262fd6fbfb05'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Survie du plus apte', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce633d70-26b3-4553-92d7-8abb140b62d9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Legge del Più Forte', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80f82208-b75f-48e8-a152-e97639bb4166'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '適者生存', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c800814b-2e67-461b-8772-83c91d58eb69'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sobrevivência do Mais Apto', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0b4155b-4e40-42c8-8084-da0a4eb059a2'}, 'multiverseid': None}]"]
